                                "example_id": "777ea1ed-d523-4110-ae5e-f049a985d9ca",
                                "sense_id": "e19770da-8e11-3079-8e75-7b31f325fc8c",
                                "text": "The water steamed and bubbled around me. I felt a rush of gratitude for it, that it should well up out of the mountain, bathe my aching body, and unthaw my frozen limbs."
